### IntelliJ HTTP client: click the green arrow next to each request.
@base = http://localhost:8080

### Create (201)
POST {{base}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "demo", "description": "first item"}

### Create duplicate (409)
POST {{base}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "demo"}

### Create invalid (400 with field details)
POST {{base}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": ""}

### List, filtered + paginated
GET {{base}}/api/items?status=PENDING&page=0&size=20

### Get one (200) / unknown (404) / bad id (400)
GET {{base}}/api/items/1

###
GET {{base}}/api/items/999999

###
GET {{base}}/api/items/abc

### Update (200)
PUT {{base}}/api/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "demo-renamed", "description": "updated"}

### Valid transition PENDING -> IN_REVIEW (200)
PATCH {{base}}/api/items/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "IN_REVIEW", "reason": "docs received"}

### IN_REVIEW -> APPROVED (200); then send REJECTED to see 409 (APPROVED is terminal)
PATCH {{base}}/api/items/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "APPROVED", "reason": "income matched"}

### Status history
GET {{base}}/api/items/1/events

### Delete (204)
DELETE {{base}}/api/items/1
